<title>GREECE: BEFORE THE BELL - Greek stocks trading ex-div Tues.</title>
<headline>BEFORE THE BELL - Greek stocks trading ex-div Tues.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens stock exchange said shares of cosmetics firm Sarantis will trade ex-dividend on Tuesday.</p>
<p>    Company     Dividend/share   Coupon    Ex-div opening price</p>
<p>    Sarantis    60 drachmas	  4		 2,425</p>
